      "statusChangeNewStatus": "available in future release",
      "value": "The Material Contacts feature currently in the `3.10.6` beta SDK is expected to remove this rate limit on contacts so they update every frame.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/material-contacts",
      "viewerReactions": null,
